  "taboutPGUFA": "About PSU First Aid",
  "taboutHeader": "PSU First Aid helps students and the wider community learn essential first aid, practice their knowledge and find useful guidance quickly.",
  "taboutHeader1": "Features:",
  "taboutParagraph": "- Step-by-step instructions for first aid procedures.\n- Topics include CPR, burns, choking, fractures, bleeding, and more.\n- Offline access to vital information.\n- Clean and simple interface for quick navigation.",
  "taboutHeader2": "Who Developed This App?",
  "taboutParagraph2": "A student project at Penza State University (PSU), created to support first-aid learning and public safety awareness.",
  "taboutHeader3": "Disclaimer:",
  "taboutParagraph3": "This app supports first-aid education and general guidance. It does not replace professional medical advice or certified first-aid training. In an emergency, contact emergency services.",
  "taboutHeader4": "Contact Us:",
  "taboutParagraph4": "For feedback or inquiries, please contact:\nyvhiku@yandex.ru",
  "tprivacyPolicy": "Privacy Policy",
  "tprivacyPolicyHeader": "How PSU First Aid handles account details, saved guides, on-device preferences and hospital map requests.",
  "tprivacyQ1": "Account and profile information",
  "tprivacyA1": "When you sign in, Firebase Authentication manages your account. Your profile may include your name, email, phone number if provided, bio and profile photo. Profile details and saved topics are stored in Firestore; uploaded profile photos are stored in Firebase Storage. Guest access uses an anonymous Firebase sign-in.",
  "tprivacyQ2": "Data on your device",
  "tprivacyA2": "The app stores language preferences, quiz progress, saved-topic copies and a local profile copy on your device. Viewed map tiles may also be cached. Signing out does not delete your cloud account or profile.",
  "tprivacyQ3": "Location and hospital maps",
  "tprivacyA3": "Device location is requested when you choose “Use my location”. You can also search a chosen map area. Map and hospital-data requests send the viewed area or search center to OpenStreetMap tile services and Overpass data services. These providers receive network information such as your IP address. Search data may be held temporarily in memory; location is not saved to your account. The app does not track your location in the background.",
  "tprivacyQ4": "Services that process data",
  "tprivacyA4": "Firebase and sign-in providers process the information needed for authentication, profile storage and synchronization. Firebase also processes technical information for security and abuse prevention. Map services process requests needed to show tiles and hospital listings. These providers handle data under their own policies. External email, phone and directions actions open other apps or websites.",
  "tprivacyQ5": "Your choices and data requests",
  "tprivacyA5": "You can edit your profile, remove saved topics and manage location permission in your device settings. For questions about access to or deletion of account data, contact support below. This version has no in-app account deletion control. Uninstalling the app does not delete information stored in your cloud account.",
  "tcontactUsIn": "Contact Us:\nyvhiku@yandex.ru",
